{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_83_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_83","textTraditional":"一、二十年，春，新作南門。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_83_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_83","textTraditional":"作，為也，有加其度也。言新，有故也，非作也。南門者，法門也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_83_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_83","textTraditional":"二、夏，郜子來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_83_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_83","textTraditional":"三、五月，己巳，西宮災。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_83_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_83","textTraditional":"謂之新宮，則近為禰宮。以謚言之，則如疏之然，以是為閔宮也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_83_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_83","textTraditional":"四、鄭人入滑。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_83_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_83","textTraditional":"五、秋，齊人、狄人盟於邢。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_83_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_83","textTraditional":"邢為主焉爾。邢小，其為主何也？其為主乎救齊。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_83_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_83","textTraditional":"六、冬，楚人伐隨。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}